  "story": {
    "title": "Fruit Fruit and More Fruit",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "We buy many fruits like apples and oranges.",
      "I really like bananas. There are many kinds of bananas. Green, yellow, orange, red and brown bananas.",
      "The market has many different kinds of fruit. Can you see pineapples, bananas, oranges, coconuts, persimmon, apples, mangoes and grapes. Cane you see the little dog hiding?",
      "﻿The apples in the apple tree are ready to pick.",
      "There are some children looking at a basket of fruit. One boy looks hungry the other children are surprised.",
      "The market man threw dirty water at the bus. The children are surprised. I wonder what the bus driver would be saying?",
      "﻿ The children are running. They are doing exercises at school.",
      "More children are running and doing exercises.",
      "My brother is testing all the different kinds of fruit. I must get there quick before he eats everything. ﻿",
      "The children are eating and enjoying mangoes.",
      "My sister in the mango tree swinging in the branches and talking to the bird. I think the bird wants to eat sweet mangoes.",
      "﻿ My mother is eating Noodles. She has already eaten some fruit.",
      "﻿ At the fruit market the man is chasing away the monkeys from eating his fruit."
    ],
    "sentences": [
      {
        "text_en": "We buy many fruits like apples and oranges.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_117276/s_000.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chúng ta mua nhiều trái cây như táo và cam."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "I really like bananas.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_117276/s_001.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Con rất thích chuối."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "There are many kinds of bananas.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_117276/s_002.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Có nhiều loại chuối lắm."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Green, yellow, orange, red and brown bananas.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_117276/s_003.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chuối xanh, vàng, cam, đỏ và nâu."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "The market has many different kinds of fruit.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_117276/s_004.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chợ có nhiều loại trái cây khác nhau."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Can you see pineapples, bananas, oranges, coconuts, persimmon, apples, mangoes and grapes.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_117276/s_005.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Con có thấy dứa, chuối, cam, dừa, hồng, táo, xoài và nho không?"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Cane you see the little dog hiding?",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_117276/s_006.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Con có thấy chú chó nhỏ đang trốn không?"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "﻿The apples in the apple tree are ready to pick.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_117276/s_007.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Những quả táo trên cây táo đã sẵn sàng để hái rồi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "There are some children looking at a basket of fruit.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_117276/s_008.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Có vài bạn nhỏ đang nhìn vào một giỏ trái cây."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "One boy looks hungry the other children are surprised.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_117276/s_009.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Một bạn trai trông có vẻ đói bụng, còn những bạn khác thì ngạc nhiên."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "The market man threw dirty water at the bus.",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_117276/s_010.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chú bán hàng ở chợ đã hắt nước bẩn vào xe buýt."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "The children are surprised.",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_117276/s_011.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Các bạn nhỏ rất ngạc nhiên."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "I wonder what the bus driver would be saying?",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_117276/s_012.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Không biết chú tài xế xe buýt sẽ nói gì nhỉ?"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "﻿ The children are running.",
        "paragraph_index": 6,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_117276/s_013.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Các bạn nhỏ đang chạy."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "They are doing exercises at school.",
        "paragraph_index": 6,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_117276/s_014.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Các bạn ấy đang tập thể dục ở trường."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "More children are running and doing exercises.",
        "paragraph_index": 7,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_117276/s_015.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Có thêm nhiều bạn nhỏ đang chạy và tập thể dục."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "My brother is testing all the different kinds of fruit.",
        "paragraph_index": 8,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_117276/s_016.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Anh trai con đang thử tất cả các loại trái cây khác nhau."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "I must get there quick before he eats everything. ﻿",
        "paragraph_index": 8,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_117276/s_017.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Con phải đến đó nhanh trước khi anh ấy ăn hết mọi thứ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "The children are eating and enjoying mangoes.",
        "paragraph_index": 9,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_117276/s_018.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Các bạn nhỏ đang ăn và rất thích xoài."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "My sister in the mango tree swinging in the branches and talking to the bird.",
        "paragraph_index": 10,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_117276/s_019.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Chị gái con đang ở trên cây xoài, đu đưa trên cành và nói chuyện với chú chim."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "I think the bird wants to eat sweet mangoes.",
        "paragraph_index": 10,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_117276/s_020.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Con nghĩ chú chim muốn ăn những quả xoài ngọt."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "﻿ My mother is eating Noodles.",
        "paragraph_index": 11,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_117276/s_021.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Mẹ con đang ăn Mì."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She has already eaten some fruit.",
        "paragraph_index": 11,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_117276/s_022.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Mẹ đã ăn một ít trái cây rồi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "﻿ At the fruit market the man is chasing away the monkeys from eating his fruit.",
        "paragraph_index": 12,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_117276/s_023.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Ở chợ trái cây, chú bán hàng đang đuổi những con khỉ đi để chúng không ăn trái cây của chú ấy."
      }
    ]
  },
